{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今年迎接出道25周年的日本歌姬中島美嘉，上周末在假東京港區舉行一連兩日共4場的《MIKA NAKASHIMA LIVE at BLUE NOTE TOKYO 2026》演唱會，但唱到在昨晚(8日)最後一場時，她因喉嚨不適，無法順利演唱下去，在演唱會開始約45分鐘後宣布中止。</p><p>主辦單位發聲明向受影響的觀眾及擔心的樂迷致歉，今後將再公布退票或補辧演唱會的安排。美嘉剛於上周推出紀念出道25周年的專輯《M25》，近排忙於四出宣傳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.170357+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:03:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:15:50.363764+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:15.507597+00:00","content_hash":"962169afc1208e31bfb2dfed00b648cac396d932361e64376da246f28657a374","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.170357+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}